message: "If you use this software, please cite it as below."
type: software
title: "Technology Park ABM: agent-based model of technology parks and innovation ecosystems"
abstract: >-
  Reproducible agent-based model of a technology park that studies when
  interactions among startups, anchor firms, universities, investors,
  workers, and park governance generate increasing returns. The model is
  deterministic under a supplied seed, performs no network calls, and ships
  with the investigation workbench (four-step journey with seeded execution
  and synthesis verdicts), experiment runners (E1-E7), global
  sensitivity analysis (Morris/Sobol), pattern-oriented validation, and a
  validated public-data pipeline.
